{"unit_id":"WongYuYe__dsh-appshots#card-zh","repo":"WongYuYe/dsh-appshots","commit":"41db2252958e7766a6053c4575a273c50db0cdc9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-appshots 是供 DSH Desktop 使用的窗口截图插件，支持 macOS 和 Windows。它在会话输入框旁提供相机按钮，也支持系统快捷键捕获当前前台窗口，再将截图附加到当前会话草稿；没有已打开会话时会创建新会话。插件还可读取系统辅助功能树中的窗口文字，并在发送消息时作为隐藏上下文交给模型；用户可在截图预览中查看读取到的文本。截图不会自动发送，默认跳过 DSH Desktop 自身窗口。它适合需要把桌面应用或窗口内容带入 DSH 对话的用户。使用 macOS 时需授予屏幕录制与辅助功能权限，Windows 首次使用可能需要编译系统助手；不需要额外 API 密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:531","lib/index.js:532","lib/index.js:784"]}
{"unit_id":"WongYuYe__dsh-appshots#card-en","repo":"WongYuYe/dsh-appshots","commit":"41db2252958e7766a6053c4575a273c50db0cdc9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-appshots captures the frontmost macOS or Windows window and attaches it to a chat draft from a camera button or hotkey. It can add accessible window text as hidden context. Captures are not sent automatically. macOS needs screen recording and accessibility permissions; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:531","lib/index.js:532","lib/index.js:784"]}
